{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Deep Values API","version":"1.0.0","description":"Programmatic access to Deep Values: curated 60-guru 13F tracking, AI-generated multi-analyst equity research, structured human investment theses, intrinsic-value calculations, and a drop-in AI-grounding context endpoint for chatbot builders.","contact":{"email":"team@deepvalues.ai","url":"https://app.deepvalues.ai/developers"},"license":{"name":"Commercial — see Terms","url":"https://app.deepvalues.ai/terms"}},"servers":[{"url":"https://app.deepvalues.ai/api/v1","description":"Production"}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"bearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"dv_sk_{env}_{32-char-base62}","description":"Mint a key with POST /keys (no account needed) or at https://app.deepvalues.ai/account/api-keys. Live keys debit a prepaid credit balance per call and count against a daily quota. Test keys (dv_sk_test_…) are never billed."}},"schemas":{"Problem":{"type":"object","description":"RFC 7807 problem details error envelope.","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","format":"uri"},"title":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"integer"},"detail":{"type":"string"}},"required":["type","title","status"]},"Guru":{"type":"object","properties":{"slug":{"type":"string","example":"warren-buffett"},"display_name":{"type":"string"},"fund_name":{"type":"string"},"style":{"type":"string","enum":["value","growth","activist","macro","quant"]}}},"Delta":{"type":"object","properties":{"status":{"type":"string","enum":["new","added","trimmed","unchanged","exited"]},"delta_shares":{"type":"integer"},"delta_pct":{"type":"number","nullable":true}}}}},"paths":{"/keys":{"post":{"summary":"Mint an API key — no account, session or browser needed","description":"The one endpoint that needs no key. Send {} for a dv_sk_test_ sandbox key (real data, small daily quota, never billed, no /research). Send {\"email\":\"…\"} for a dv_sk_live_ key on a new prepaid account; the first key for an email carries 1 starter credit ($1.00). Send it with an existing key as the bearer to mint a sibling key on the same account (rotation). The raw key is returned once. The email is a contact label, not a credential.","security":[],"requestBody":{"required":false,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"email":{"type":"string","format":"email","description":"Contact address for a live key. Omit for a sandbox key."},"label":{"type":"string","maxLength":80}}}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Created — { key, environment, starterGrant, balanceMicro, next }"},"400":{"description":"Invalid email"},"429":{"description":"Per-IP daily key limit reached"},"503":{"description":"Key issuance unavailable"}}}},"/keys/me":{"get":{"summary":"This key: exact credit balance, remaining quota, environment","description":"Returns the calling key, the exact balance of the ledger behind it (balanceMicro: integer micro-credits, 1 credit = $1.00 = 1,000,000), what is left in each daily quota bucket, and the environment. Free, and consumes no quota.","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"401":{"description":"Missing / invalid key","content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Problem"}}}}}},"delete":{"summary":"Revoke this key","description":"The calling key stops authenticating immediately. Any credit balance stays on the account, reachable through its other keys.","responses":{"200":{"description":"Revoked"},"401":{"description":"Missing / invalid key"}}}},"/credits/checkout":{"get":{"summary":"Credit packs on sale","description":"Lists the prepaid credit packs this key can buy (1 credit = $1.00). Free.","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK — { packs: [{ pack, credits, label }] }"}}},"post":{"summary":"Get a Stripe Checkout URL that tops up this key’s balance","description":"Creates a one-time Stripe Checkout Session for a credit pack, bound to the calling live key’s account. When the payment completes the credits land on that balance; poll GET /keys/me. This is what a 402 `topUp.checkoutEndpoint` points at. Free, consumes no quota.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["pack"],"properties":{"pack":{"type":"string","enum":["1000","5000","20000"]}}}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Created — { checkoutUrl, sessionId, pack, credits, expiresAt }"},"400":{"description":"Unknown or unavailable pack"},"403":{"description":"Test keys cannot buy credits"}}}},"/account":{"get":{"summary":"Account info + current quota usage","description":"Returns the calling key, its scopes, environment, and today's usage across all 3 buckets. Self-billing: counts as 1 metadata call.","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"401":{"description":"Missing / invalid key","content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Problem"}}}}}}},"/smart-money/holdings":{"get":{"summary":"Which curated gurus hold this ticker","description":"Returns every guru from our 60-name roster who held the requested ticker as of the latest 13F-HR quarter (or a specific historical quarter). Each row includes shares, USD value, % of portfolio, and the auto-classified delta vs the prior quarter.","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[A-Z]{1,5}([.-][A-Z]{1,2})?$"},"example":"AAPL"},{"name":"quarter_end","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"description":"ISO date; default = latest available"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"400":{"description":"Invalid ticker","content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Problem"}}}}}}},"/smart-money/changes":{"get":{"summary":"Material guru moves in a time window","description":"All 13F position changes meeting the materiality threshold (new positions, full exits, ≥25% share-count shifts, OR ≥$100M position size) across our entire 60-guru roster, in the requested window.","parameters":[{"name":"since","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"2026-Q1","description":"ISO date OR YYYY-QN format. Filters on the QUARTER a position belongs to (quarter_end), not on when it was filed."},{"name":"filed_since","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"example":"2026-08-10","description":"Only rows that reached us on or after this date (each row carries filed_at). Use it to poll for genuinely new 13F filings; `since` alone cannot tell a filing from this week from one made months ago in the same quarter."},{"name":"min_position_usd","in":"query","schema":{"type":"number"},"example":100000000},{"name":"status","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["new","added","trimmed","exited"]}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/gurus/moves":{"get":{"summary":"Material guru moves, newest filing first, each with its verdict","description":"The Follow the Pros feed. Every material 13F move — new position, full exit, a share count that moved by 25%, or a position of $100M or more — ordered by the date the filing became public, with a deterministic verdict line on each row. The verdict is identical for every caller: it compares the price when the investor traded, the price now and Deep Values' intrinsic value band, and it never predicts a return or recommends an action. Every row carries the company's legal name beside the ticker (`name`, e.g. \"Occidental Petroleum\"), or null where we hold none — null rather than the ticker echoed back, so a caller can tell a real name from a placeholder. Rows whose EDGAR filing date we do not yet hold fall back to when the row reached us and say so with filed_at_known: false.","parameters":[{"name":"filed_since","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"example":"2026-08-01","description":"Only moves filed on or after this date. Poll with it."},{"name":"slugs","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"warren-buffett,li-lu","description":"Comma-separated guru slugs; default is every guru."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":200,"default":50}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"400":{"description":"Invalid filed_since or limit","content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Problem"}}}}}}},"/verdict/{ticker}":{"get":{"summary":"The verdict line for one filed move","description":"One guru's disclosed move in one ticker, with the sentence Deep Values publishes about it and every number behind it: the company's legal name beside the ticker (`name`, null where we hold none), the three dates (traded by, filed, seen), the quarter-end close, the current price, and the intrinsic value band. `value` is the callable band (the blend ±25%) and is null whenever the verdict is not a call; `estimates` always carries what the valuation methods actually said, their lowest and highest central estimate, so a reader told we cannot call it can see why. One of six deterministic states — below_value, inside_band, above_value, ran_ahead, too_uncertain, no_value — computed the same way for every caller. The band is Deep Values' blended intrinsic value plus or minus 25%, and `too_uncertain` (\"Our estimates disagree too much to call this one.\") replaces the three band states when the methods' own central estimates are more than 3x apart, or one of them is not positive: the blend still exists and is still returned in `value`, but it is not a range anyone should be told a price sits inside. It is distinct from `no_value`, which means no valuation was computed at all.","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"OXY"},{"name":"guru","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"warren-buffett"},{"name":"quarter","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"example":"2026-06-30","description":"Quarter end; default = the most recent quarter we hold."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"400":{"description":"Invalid ticker, missing guru, or malformed quarter","content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Problem"}}}},"404":{"description":"No such move"}}}},"/mirror-brief/{ticker}":{"get":{"summary":"An impersonal brief on one filed move, for an agent to act on","description":"The same move as /verdict, flattened into a brief: what the investor did, when, at what price, against our value band, plus the verdict sentence. It carries NO quantity and NO instruction — `sizing` reads \"not provided; the reader decides\". It describes a public filing and a published value range; it is not advice and not a prediction.","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"OXY"},{"name":"guru","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"warren-buffett"},{"name":"quarter","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"400":{"description":"Invalid ticker, missing guru, or malformed quarter","content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Problem"}}}},"404":{"description":"No such move"}}}},"/gurus":{"get":{"summary":"Curated guru roster","description":"60 hand-picked institutional investors — every name a serious value investor would recognize. Filter by style.","parameters":[{"name":"style","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["value","growth","activist","macro","quant"]}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":200,"default":100}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/gurus/{slug}":{"get":{"summary":"One guru: bio + top holdings","parameters":[{"name":"slug","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"warren-buffett"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"404":{"description":"Slug not found"}}}},"/gurus/{slug}/portfolio":{"get":{"summary":"One guru's full portfolio at a quarter","parameters":[{"name":"slug","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"as_of","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"404":{"description":"Slug or quarter not found"}}}},"/theses":{"get":{"summary":"Structured human investment theses","description":"Public investment theses with structured metadata — sentiment, conviction, price target, anchored DVI run. Filter by ticker, conviction, or sentiment.","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"min_conviction","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":5}},{"name":"sentiment","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["bullish","bearish","neutral"]}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":200,"default":50}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/intrinsic-value/{ticker}":{"get":{"summary":"DCF + Owner Earnings + Damodaran intrinsic value","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"404":{"description":"Ticker not found or not yet valued"}}}},"/indicators/buffett":{"get":{"summary":"Buffett Indicator with zone classification","description":"US corporate equities ÷ GDP, with zones (significantly undervalued through significantly overvalued) and historical percentile.","parameters":[{"name":"history_years","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":50,"default":5}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/indicators/shiller-pe":{"get":{"summary":"Shiller PE with historical percentile","parameters":[{"name":"history_years","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":100,"default":5}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/companies":{"get":{"summary":"Company search","parameters":[{"name":"q","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":100,"default":20}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/companies/{ticker}/overview":{"get":{"summary":"Company overview","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/fundamentals/{ticker}":{"get":{"summary":"Income + balance + cashflow","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"period","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["annual","quarterly"],"default":"annual"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":20,"default":5}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/filings/{ticker}":{"get":{"summary":"SEC filings (10-K, 10-Q, 8-K, etc)","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"form","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"10-K"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":50,"default":10}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/news/{ticker}":{"get":{"summary":"Sentiment-scored news","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"since","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"}},{"name":"sentiment","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["bullish","bearish","neutral"]}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/sentiment/{ticker}":{"get":{"summary":"Value-investor sentiment rollup (not WSB noise)","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"source","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["reddit","stocktwits","combined"],"default":"combined"}},{"name":"window","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["24h","7d","30d"],"default":"7d"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/research/{ticker}":{"get":{"summary":"AI multi-analyst research briefing (HEADLINE)","description":"The differentiated endpoint: full briefing, bull case, bear case, valuation, investment plan, fair-value range. Bills against your ai_research quota (50/day at $99/mo, $0.10 overage). Currently returns cached results only; fresh-trigger via API arriving next release.","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"language","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["English","Chinese"],"default":"English"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK — full briefing"},"404":{"description":"No cached run yet — kick one off via the web app and retry"}}}},"/ai-context/{ticker}":{"get":{"summary":"Drop-in AI grounding context (DIFFERENTIATED)","description":"Returns a system prompt + structured context block, scoped to one ticker. Drop it into OpenAI/Anthropic/any LLM SDK to ground your chatbot in current Deep Values data without months of plumbing. Bills 3 metadata units.","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"token_budget","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1000,"maximum":16000,"default":6000}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/webhooks":{"get":{"summary":"List webhook subscriptions","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}},"post":{"summary":"Create webhook subscription","description":"Subscribe to event types. Returns a signing_secret (shown once) used to verify the X-DV-Signature header on every delivery.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["url","events"],"properties":{"url":{"type":"string","format":"uri"},"events":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["guru.move.material","filing.new","sentiment.shift","research.completed"]}},"label":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Created"},"400":{"description":"Invalid URL or events"},"429":{"description":"Subscription cap reached (10 per key)"}}}},"/webhooks/{id}":{"delete":{"summary":"Delete a webhook subscription","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"404":{"description":"Not found"}}}},"/webhooks/{id}/test":{"post":{"summary":"Send a test delivery to a webhook subscription","description":"Queues a synthetic event delivery against the named subscription so integrators can verify signing-secret rotation and end-to-end delivery without waiting for a real event. Counts against the webhook_events metered quota.","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Test delivery queued"},"404":{"description":"Subscription not found"},"429":{"description":"Quota exceeded"}}}}}}